  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ccore#triggers">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ccore#ThreatPerdurant"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ccore#ThreatPerdurant"/>
    <rdfs:comment>A minimal definition based on temporal precedence only (anything about causality yet).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>triggers(E, E1) --&gt;
∃ T, T1. ThreatPerdurant(E), ThreatPerdurant(E1),
time:hasTime(E, T), time:hasTime(E1, T1), 
time:intervalOverlaps(T, T1) .</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
