    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="n16260563f62b42f1bc9a7e86ac636a9bb93"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Vulnerability(V) --&gt;
∃ O, P, Q1, G. PhysicalEndurant(O) ∨ EcosystemService(O), ThreatPerdurant(P), Quality(Q1), Goal(G),
participantOf(O, P), isQualityOf(Q1, O), intendedGoalFor(G, O),
inheresIn(V, O), proxyContent(V, Q1), manifestedBy(V, P), refersTo(V, G) .</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
