  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ccore#influences">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ccore#Exposure"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ccore#Vulnerability"/>
    <rdfs:comment>[According to the diagrams in https://github.com/KnowWhereGraph/dmdo/blob/main/modules/disaster-properties-module/schema-diagrams/vulnerability.PNG this should be http://knowwheregraph/ontology/dpo#influences but, the property is not present in the formal specification of dpo.]</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>dpo:influences(Exp, V) --&gt; 
∃ O, P. Exposure(Exp), Vulnerability(V), PhysicalEndurant(O), ThreatPerdurant(P),
exposedObject(Exp, O), participates(Exp, P),
inheresIn(V, O), manifestedBy(V, P) .

dpo:influences(Exp, V) --&gt; Exposure(Exp), Vulnerability(V) .</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="n16260563f62b42f1bc9a7e86ac636a9bb76">
